        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>With the help of Mattia, the Plane Wiki has been updated. Click Read More to view the new changes.</p>
<p><strong>747-100</strong>, <strong>747-200</strong>, <strong>747-300</strong>, <strong>747-400</strong> and <strong>747-8</strong> have been added, as well as their F variants and their images.</p>
